# Architecture Overview

SilentPay follows a **modular monolithic architecture**.

Instead of separating everything into multiple microservices, the application will have:

- One Next.js application
- One PostgreSQL database
- One Midnight smart contract
- One API layer
- One frontend

This keeps the project easy to understand while remaining scalable.

---

# Why Modular Monolith?

Hackathons reward **working software**, not infrastructure complexity.

A modular monolith provides:

✅ Faster development

✅ Easier debugging

✅ Less deployment complexity

✅ Simpler database management

✅ Easier Midnight integration

Future versions can split into microservices if required.

