The frontend should **only be responsible for presentation**.

It should never contain:

- Business logic
- Database queries
- Midnight contract logic
- Payroll calculations

Instead, it should:

- Display data
- Collect user input
- Validate forms
- Call backend APIs
- Render success/error states

