# Midnight Architecture

## Why Midnight?

SilentPay exists because of Midnight.

Without Midnight, salaries would be visible on-chain.

Midnight provides:

- Private State
- Zero-Knowledge Proofs
- Confidential Smart Contracts
- Selective Disclosure

SilentPay treats Midnight as the **source of truth for confidential payroll data**.

---

