# Architecture Summary

SilentPay follows a layered, modular monolith architecture designed specifically to showcase Midnight's privacy model while remaining practical to build within the Midnight Builder Program timeline.

The architecture separates concerns between presentation, business logic, persistence, and blockchain interaction, ensuring the application is maintainable, scalable, and secure. PostgreSQL stores only application metadata, while Midnight remains the authoritative source for confidential payroll information, allowing the product to demonstrate meaningful privacy guarantees rather than simply hiding data in the frontend.

